{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2012-03", "window": 3, "start_date": 1331856000, "end_date": 1332547199, "month_true_total": 30, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:45:47 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "4081975", "author": {"steamid": "76561198031756324", "personaname": "Sky Shaman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/StygianRaven93/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 1166, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1166, "last_played": 1319698800, "avatar": "ac96a1f994560b9a1f4bd90fd6c4f8c51a7513c0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Being a long time fan of the world of Warhammer 40k, I was not disappointed by this game the campaign was hours of fun. Hacking, slasing, and blasting you way through hordes of greenskins and their ilk was titilating. Not to mention more fun enemies I wont name, I enjoyed the game overall. There is even a decent multiplayer server with good ol fashin' tdm and the like, and with full armor customization I enjoyed jumping headlong into other players. A truly great game I give it a 8.5/10.", "timestamp_created": 1332387636, "timestamp_updated": 1332387636, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "545373", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971945551", "personaname": "Sovos", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sovos/", "num_games_owned": 1160, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 29245, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 22989, "last_played": 1527540109, "avatar": "3464fd2594fb6edae06d510084282084b23b6bea"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nails the dark feeling of the 40K universe. Single player is somewhat short but enjoyable. The multiplayer vs. and co-op exterminatus modes are pretty well polished. As an action/shooter, the game is above average but nothing groundbreaking. If you also like 40K, the game is awesome and hard to put down.\n\n*The dreadnaught DLC isn't very wide-spread among the playerbase, so you may have a hard time finding a game for it.", "timestamp_created": 1332371579, "timestamp_updated": 1332371579, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "850398", "author": {"steamid": "76561197980088302", "personaname": "Felerian01 ☆☆☆☆", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/felerian01/", "num_games_owned": 606, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 1060, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1026, "last_played": 1378857442, "avatar": "4962bb96fc7cb93bf7e457cfff74457669c82ad8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Exciting 9/10 points Singleplayer Campaign with a cool story, nice grafics and cool effects. Must have for any Warhammer fans!\nThe multiplayer could have been a ton of fun, but they hardly reached 1/10 points. No serverbrowser and no dedicated servers... worthless matchmaking via p2p, worse ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ then modern warfare 2. It is very frustrating to play Spacemarine online as it takes forever to find matches and it lags like hell switching host every few minutes. That way its hard to level up and unlock achievements.", "timestamp_created": 1332367883, "timestamp_updated": 1332367883, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "977076", "author": {"steamid": "76561197983492431", "personaname": "Fearsome", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197983492431/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 4779, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4777, "last_played": 1777152900, "avatar": "e4663e578d1bef5e6e1eb5100e0f0dd05386f57f"}, "language": "english", "review": "For the Emperor!", "timestamp_created": 1332361292, "timestamp_updated": 1332361292, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "150191", "author": {"steamid": "76561197963453112", "personaname": "Leukos", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/_Warcry/", "num_games_owned": 368, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 1043, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 798, "last_played": 1452904976, "avatar": "713dd50aef59127ecd718fff5cfa8fcd414cb7e2"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game had only one thing to do to make it fantastic: make it feel like you're really a 40k Space Marine capable of turning tides of battle whenever you show up and thankfully this game does this in spades. Great horde mode but it's hampered by the dreadful online p2p netcode.", "timestamp_created": 1332301178, "timestamp_updated": 1332301178, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}